        "description": "One CARFAX used-car listing by VIN (or link): everything in /carfax/v1/listings for the car plus the free history snapshot rows, price history and all features. `latest=true` returns the first car of CARFAX's Toyota page (a durable example). A VIN with no current listing answers 404.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/carfax-vehicle",
